r of #877 (first,\nand more complete there) — no conflict between the two; they can merge\nin either order.\n\nGate: `legacy_name_ratchet.py` → **No new lines. 4 removed by this\nchange (-4 net).**\n\nDocs-only; no code paths touched.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0129mDPbfSxqBrCLs5dDpcGv\n\nSigned-off-by: erni <erni@caura.ai>","tree":{"sha":"46961de4bcaf8658706222bf3b570e41042ff59e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/46961de4bcaf8658706222bf3b570e41042ff59e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/commits/8d66a9c458bc01b23a358cc264544821df999b08","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiqK5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbZ8QADQZcYJ5h0UE8lRWisjoifpb\nMmmCshIqCZVGyO9KLSYkGlb9v6uRh5s4Kwu2H8mYsv31xFl7aWqdGOt/3x/6fIwu\nYdYaUy+/2nnZJCfIpMFSxLycN+tWzubPDMXPt5QlWcN9HS4RcLoQ3MAU9P0GEJv/\nB4BmKpjcSX/1N033nfXkomrPOs/xkiahwl2d/s+GPiyCEE1TNJ0vuD3GtD39JxYr\nxQ5YQHgbuxLOc410rS2PFvOh5IeYCFjQ1eCD243cAI6dtT+7G2FcaqhBymDwS6Ws\nZY3ADFiiuNktU8bXWbjDoa5PQQin5FAZp2IizkMRfHZvqTQ1ZDayU97aJ7RRlgVV\n/4Y9LUbbdJ2bme4xp4WnbcqcRP+IYAgWmtRgiO53cXAGG5d2BpLApkui7PipzLPh\nD9e5RGiFS+OHYYZtYCkVqG+IOHSrk3d66P/ODAiWSy0f9RHQZPyUAQ5Yvok5Gca7\nKGqWktS9AH0cUN4+wlD1t25+/NYvJhuDHvqgTkBzFx51/N+5l6dnUShkLWHAQt9L\nHO16vbsfNkwoGWi1XpG+JKHzqjAg6QvBwXKsFvdPLfb272jfxCq7+kyKUSbkuoMu\n5i83BmDw7h/sRIXWIPAVhineWmRhht/6azuJ7KI2/JHtFuhrbfKhlLIvzlIbQHj0\nXnGKTQbDoycpUMidXvbU\n=vsWp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 46961de4bcaf8658706222bf3b570e41042ff59e\nparent 20a59e0d32bfe1065bffe72e934422b7e87e6688\nauthor erni-a <erni@caura.ai> 1787470521 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787470521 +0300\n\ndocs: the same broken cd in the setup docs #877 fixes in the README (#878)\n\n**Companion to #877** — same root cause, different files. #774 updated\nevery `git clone` URL to `caura.git` but missed the `cd caura-memclaw`\n